@startuml sequence-application-review
!theme plain
title 使用案例2: 申請審核作業

actor "送養者\n(一般會員或收容所會員)" as Reviewer
participant "applications.py\n(Blueprint)" as ApplicationsAPI
participant "application_service.py" as ApplicationService
participant "permission_service.py" as PermissionService
participant "application.py\n(Model)" as ApplicationModel
participant "animal.py\n(Model)" as AnimalModel
participant "user.py\n(Model)" as UserModel
participant "notification_service.py" as NotificationService
participant "email_tasks.py\n(Celery Task)" as EmailTask
database "MySQL" as DB
queue "Celery Queue" as CeleryQueue

== 前置條件: 瀏覽申請列表 ==
note over Reviewer
  前置條件: 使用者在「申請列表瀏覽」
  作業中選擇待審核申請
end note

Reviewer -> ApplicationsAPI: GET /api/applications?mode=review\n[查看待審核申請]
activate ApplicationsAPI
note right: mode=review: 只顯示別人對自己動物的申請
ApplicationsAPI -> ApplicationsAPI: @jwt_required()\n驗證 JWT Token
ApplicationsAPI -> UserModel: User.query.get(current_user_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE user_id=?
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: User 記錄
deactivate DB
UserModel --> ApplicationsAPI: User 物件
deactivate UserModel

ApplicationsAPI -> ApplicationService: list_applications(\nuser, mode='review'\n)
activate ApplicationService

ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: Application.query.filter_by(\ndeleted_at=None\n)
activate ApplicationModel

alt user.role == ADMIN
    ApplicationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\nWHERE deleted_at IS NULL
    activate DB
    DB --> ApplicationModel: 所有申請記錄
    deactivate DB
else user.role == GENERAL_MEMBER || SHELTER_MEMBER
    ApplicationModel -> AnimalModel: 查詢 owned_animal_ids\n(owner_id || shelter_id)
    activate AnimalModel
    AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT animal_id FROM animals\nWHERE owner_id=? OR shelter_id=?
    activate DB
    DB --> AnimalModel: owned_animal_ids
    deactivate DB
    AnimalModel --> ApplicationModel: owned_animal_ids
    deactivate AnimalModel
    
    ApplicationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\nWHERE animal_id IN (...)\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
    activate DB
    DB --> ApplicationModel: 申請記錄
    deactivate DB
end

ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: 申請列表
deactivate ApplicationModel

ApplicationService --> ApplicationsAPI: 申請列表
deactivate ApplicationService
ApplicationsAPI --> Reviewer: 200 OK\n{ items: [...], total, pages }
deactivate ApplicationsAPI

== 查看申請詳細資料 ==
Reviewer -> ApplicationsAPI: GET /api/applications/{application_id}\n[查看申請詳情]
activate ApplicationsAPI

ApplicationsAPI -> ApplicationsAPI: @jwt_required()\n驗證 JWT Token
ApplicationsAPI -> UserModel: User.query.get(current_user_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE user_id=?
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: User 記錄
deactivate DB
UserModel --> ApplicationsAPI: User 物件
deactivate UserModel

ApplicationsAPI -> ApplicationService: get_application(\napplication_id, user\n)
activate ApplicationService

ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: Application.query.filter_by(\napplication_id, deleted_at=None\n).first()
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\nWHERE application_id=?\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
activate DB
DB --> ApplicationModel: Application 記錄
deactivate DB
ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: Application 物件
deactivate ApplicationModel

ApplicationService -> PermissionService: can_view_application(user, application)
activate PermissionService

PermissionService -> PermissionService: 檢查申請人本人?\napplicant_id == user.user_id

alt 不是申請人
    PermissionService -> PermissionService: 檢查管理員?\nuser.role == ADMIN
    
    alt 不是管理員
        PermissionService -> PermissionService: 檢查是否為動物管理者?\ncan_manage_animal(user, animal)
        note right
          個人送養: owner_id == user_id
          收容所送養: shelter_id == user.primary_shelter_id
        end note
    end
end

PermissionService --> ApplicationsAPI: True (有權限)
deactivate PermissionService

ApplicationsAPI -> ApplicationModel: application.applicant\n(lazy loading)
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel -> UserModel: User.query.get(applicant_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE user_id=?
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: User 記錄
deactivate DB
UserModel --> ApplicationModel: applicant
deactivate UserModel

ApplicationModel -> AnimalModel: application.animal\n(lazy loading)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE animal_id=?
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: Animal 記錄
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> ApplicationModel: animal
deactivate AnimalModel
ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: 完整 Application 資料
deactivate ApplicationModel

ApplicationService --> ApplicationsAPI: Application 物件
deactivate ApplicationService
ApplicationsAPI --> Reviewer: 200 OK\n{ application (含 applicant, animal 資訊) }
deactivate ApplicationsAPI

note over Reviewer
  送養者檢視申請內容:
  - 申請人基本資料
  - 聯絡方式
  - 居住環境
  - 飼養經驗
  - 申請理由
end note

== 進行審核評估與填寫意見 ==
note over Reviewer
  送養者進行審核評估
  填寫審核意見 (review_notes)
  選擇審核結果: 核准 (approve) 或拒絕 (reject)
end note

== 提交審核結果 ==
Reviewer -> ApplicationsAPI: POST /api/applications/{application_id}/review
activate ApplicationsAPI
note right
  {
    "action": "approve" | "reject",
    "review_notes": "審核意見...",
    "version": 1  // 樂觀鎖
  }
end note

ApplicationsAPI -> ApplicationsAPI: @jwt_required()\n驗證 JWT Token
ApplicationsAPI -> UserModel: User.query.get(current_user_id)
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE user_id=?
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: User 記錄
deactivate DB
UserModel --> ApplicationsAPI: User 物件
deactivate UserModel

ApplicationsAPI -> ApplicationService: review_application(\napplication_id, reviewer,\naction, review_notes, version)
activate ApplicationService

ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: Application.query.filter_by(\n  application_id, deleted_at=None\n).first()
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\nWHERE application_id=?\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
activate DB
DB --> ApplicationModel: Application 記錄
deactivate DB
ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: Application 物件
deactivate ApplicationModel

ApplicationService -> PermissionService: can_review_application(reviewer, application)
activate PermissionService

PermissionService -> ApplicationModel: application.animal
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel -> AnimalModel: Animal.query.get(animal_id)
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE animal_id=?
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: Animal 記錄
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> ApplicationModel: Animal 物件
deactivate AnimalModel
ApplicationModel --> PermissionService: animal
deactivate ApplicationModel

alt animal.owner_id 存在 (個人送養)
    PermissionService -> PermissionService: 檢查 owner_id == user.user_id
    note right: 只有動物擁有者可審核
else animal.shelter_id 存在 (收容所送養)
    PermissionService -> PermissionService: 檢查 user.role == SHELTER_MEMBER\n&& user.primary_shelter_id == animal.shelter_id
    note right: 該收容所的成員可審核
end

alt reviewer.role == ADMIN
    PermissionService --> ApplicationService: False
    ApplicationService --> ApplicationsAPI: PermissionDeniedError\n"領養申請應由送養人或收容所成員審核,\n管理員無權審核"
    ApplicationsAPI --> Reviewer: 403 Forbidden
    deactivate PermissionService
    deactivate ApplicationService
    deactivate ApplicationsAPI
    note over Reviewer
      管理員不能審核送養申請
      (商業規則限制)
    end note
else 無權限
    PermissionService --> ApplicationService: False
    ApplicationService --> ApplicationsAPI: PermissionDeniedError
    ApplicationsAPI --> Reviewer: 403 Forbidden
    deactivate PermissionService
    deactivate ApplicationService
    deactivate ApplicationsAPI
end

PermissionService --> ApplicationService: True (有權限)
deactivate PermissionService

ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 驗證 action\nif action not in ['approve', 'reject']:\n  raise ValidationError

ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 檢查申請狀態\nif status not in [PENDING, UNDER_REVIEW]:\n  raise ValidationError

ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 樂觀鎖檢查\nif version != application.version:\n  raise ConflictError\n  "申請已被其他人修改"

ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 保存舊狀態\nold_status = application.status

alt action == 'approve' (核准)
    ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: application.status = APPROVED\napplication.assignee_id = reviewer.user_id\napplication.reviewed_at = now()
    activate ApplicationModel
    ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: 屬性已更新
    deactivate ApplicationModel
    
    ApplicationService -> AnimalModel: animal.status = ADOPTED\nanimal.updated_at = now()
    activate AnimalModel
    note right: 核准後該動物不會在公開清單
    AnimalModel --> ApplicationService: 屬性已更新
    deactivate AnimalModel
    
else action == 'reject' (拒絕)
    ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: application.status = REJECTED\napplication.assignee_id = reviewer.user_id\napplication.reviewed_at = now()
    activate ApplicationModel
    note right: 動物狀態不變,仍可接受其他申請
    ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: 屬性已更新
    deactivate ApplicationModel
end

ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: application.review_notes = review_notes\napplication.version += 1
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: 屬性已更新
deactivate ApplicationModel

ApplicationService -> DB: db.session.commit()
activate DB
DB -> DB: UPDATE applications SET...\nUPDATE animals SET... (if approved)
DB --> ApplicationService: 更新成功
deactivate DB

== 記錄審計日誌 ==
ApplicationService -> DB: 寫入審計日誌\naudit_service.log_application_review()
activate DB
note right
  記錄:
  - application_id
  - reviewer_id
  - old_status -> new_status
  - timestamp
end note
DB --> ApplicationService: 審計日誌已記錄
deactivate DB

== 發送通知給申請人 ==
ApplicationService -> NotificationService: notify_application_reviewed(\napplication, reviewer_id,\nstatus, review_notes)
activate NotificationService

NotificationService -> DB: 建立 Notification 記錄
activate DB
note right
  type: 'application_approved' | 'application_rejected'
  recipient_id: application.applicant_id
  actor_id: reviewer.user_id
  payload: { animal_name, status, review_notes }
end note
DB -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications
DB --> NotificationService: 通知已建立
deactivate DB
NotificationService --> ApplicationService: 通知已發送
deactivate NotificationService

== 發送 Email 通知 (非同步) ==
ApplicationService -> ApplicationModel: 取得申請人和動物資訊
activate ApplicationModel
ApplicationModel -> UserModel: application.applicant
activate UserModel
UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users
activate DB
DB --> UserModel: applicant
deactivate DB
UserModel --> ApplicationModel: applicant
deactivate UserModel

ApplicationModel -> AnimalModel: application.animal
activate AnimalModel
AnimalModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals
activate DB
DB --> AnimalModel: animal
deactivate DB
AnimalModel --> ApplicationModel: animal
deactivate AnimalModel
ApplicationModel --> ApplicationService: applicant, animal
deactivate ApplicationModel

alt applicant.email 存在
    alt animal.owner_id 存在
        ApplicationService -> UserModel: User.query.get(owner_id)
        activate UserModel
        UserModel -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE user_id=?
        activate DB
        DB --> UserModel: owner 記錄
        deactivate DB
        UserModel --> ApplicationService: owner 資訊
        deactivate UserModel
        ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 準備聯絡資訊\ncontact_info = { type: 'owner',\nname, email, phone }
    else animal.shelter_id 存在
        ApplicationService -> DB: 查詢 shelter (Shelter)
        activate DB
        DB --> ApplicationService: shelter 資訊
        deactivate DB
        ApplicationService -> ApplicationService: 準備聯絡資訊\ncontact_info = { type: 'shelter',\nname, email, phone }
    end
    
    ApplicationService -> EmailTask: send_application_notification_email_task.delay(\napplicant.email, animal.name,\nstatus, review_notes, contact_info)
    activate EmailTask
    note right: Celery 非同步任務
    
    EmailTask -> CeleryQueue: 加入任務佇列
    activate CeleryQueue
    CeleryQueue --> EmailTask: task_id
    deactivate CeleryQueue
    EmailTask --> ApplicationService: 任務已排程
    deactivate EmailTask
end

ApplicationService --> ApplicationsAPI: Application 物件\n(status = APPROVED/REJECTED)
deactivate ApplicationService

ApplicationsAPI --> Reviewer: 200 OK\n{ message: "申請已核准/拒絕", application }
deactivate ApplicationsAPI

note over Reviewer
  審核完成:
  - 系統通知申請人審核結果
  - 如核准,該動物不會在公開清單
  - 申請人會收到站內通知和 Email
end note

== 非同步 Email 發送 (背景執行) ==
CeleryQueue -> EmailTask: 執行任務
activate CeleryQueue
activate EmailTask
EmailTask -> EmailTask: 渲染 Email 模板\napplication_notification.html
EmailTask -> EmailTask: SMTP 發送郵件\nsmtplib.send_message()
note over EmailTask
  Email 內容包含:
  - 審核結果 (核准/拒絕)
  - 動物名稱
  - 審核意見
  - 聯絡資訊 (核准時)
end note
EmailTask --> CeleryQueue: 任務完成
deactivate EmailTask
deactivate CeleryQueue

@enduml
